Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":43,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":4154,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1444055,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":229614,"Name":"jszy10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229614.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1304232716,"LastPoster":{"Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1444055,"PostDate":1304232716,"PostContent":"Ok girls! Just finished all of my bouquets and boutonnieres and thought I would share!  \u00a0  First...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jszy10@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"204.13.205.130","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1277656152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229614.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jszy10","Id":229614,"Name":"jszy10","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60959,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55c80a233268e176dcb8429d9a625583","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ok girls! Just finished all of my bouquets and boutonnieres and thought I would share!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; First off, I bought orange and white tiger lilies at the end of spring last year for a super low price at Joann&#039;s.&amp;nbsp; I think for all of&amp;nbsp;my AHR centerpiece flowers&amp;nbsp;and bouquet flowers together cost me less than $30!!!&amp;nbsp; So I definitely suggest looking out for sales.&amp;nbsp; I just bought the extra white&amp;nbsp;lilies I needed for my bouquet at Michaels on sale and they were $.89 for a bunch of 6 flowers!&amp;nbsp; Can&#039;t beat it!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224122\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224119\"&gt; As far as putting them together goes, I just cut the bunches apart, put together the flowers until the arrangement looked nice, and wrapped it with floral tape (AC Moore or any craft store).&amp;nbsp; Then I wrapped white ribbon down the stem and back up (secured at the top before and after the wrap with a plain silver sewing pin).&amp;nbsp; Then&amp;nbsp;I took orange ribbon and cris-crossed it down the stems, tying it in the back on the bottom when I was done.&amp;nbsp; My mom put a little clear&amp;nbsp;elmers&amp;nbsp;glue across the criss-crosses in the back of the bouquet to make sure nothing shifted, and you can&#039;t even tell its there.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224137\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224138\"&gt; Honestly, there were pretty easy and extremely inexpensive to do myself.&amp;nbsp; Just for the bouquets, I can probably estimate that I paid about $20 to get 5 girls bouquets and my bouquet done&amp;nbsp;-- and I had them all done in a matter of a few hours!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; and finally....some pics!!&amp;nbsp; :o)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The girls&#039; bouquets:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"100_3623.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/399549\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; an upclose of my bouquet (I used some floral pearls and more flowers to accent mine from the girls):&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"100_3640.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/399553\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For the guys&#039; boutonnieres we just bought a basic boutonniere flower stem at AC Moore for maybe $1 or so, and hot glued white and blue ribbon, the starfish and a bin back on them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224148\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224147\"&gt; The guys are wearing orange shirts, so they should stand out nicely:&lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"100_3634.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/399555\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1444055,"PostDate":1304232716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ok girls! Just finished all of my bouquets and boutonnieres and thought I would share!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> First off, I bought orange and white tiger lilies at the end of spring last year for a super low price at Joann's.\u00a0 I think for all of\u00a0my AHR centerpiece flowers\u00a0and bouquet flowers together cost me less than $30!!!\u00a0 So I definitely suggest looking out for sales.\u00a0 I just bought the extra white\u00a0lilies I needed for my bouquet at Michaels on sale and they were $.89 for a bunch of 6 flowers!\u00a0 Can't beat it!<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224122\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224119\"> As far as putting them together goes, I just cut the bunches apart, put together the flowers until the arrangement looked nice, and wrapped it with floral tape (AC Moore or any craft store).\u00a0 Then I wrapped white ribbon down the stem and back up (secured at the top before and after the wrap with a plain silver sewing pin).\u00a0 Then\u00a0I took orange ribbon and cris-crossed it down the stems, tying it in the back on the bottom when I was done.\u00a0 My mom put a little clear\u00a0elmers\u00a0glue across the criss-crosses in the back of the bouquet to make sure nothing shifted, and you can't even tell its there.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224137\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224138\"> Honestly, there were pretty easy and extremely inexpensive to do myself.\u00a0 Just for the bouquets, I can probably estimate that I paid about $20 to get 5 girls bouquets and my bouquet done\u00a0-- and I had them all done in a matter of a few hours!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> and finally....some pics!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The girls' bouquets:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"100_3623.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/399549\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> <\/p> <p> an upclose of my bouquet (I used some floral pearls and more flowers to accent mine from the girls):<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"100_3640.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/399553\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the guys' boutonnieres we just bought a basic boutonniere flower stem at AC Moore for maybe $1 or so, and hot glued white and blue ribbon, the starfish and a bin back on them.\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224148\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304249801224147\"> The guys are wearing orange shirts, so they should stand out nicely:<span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"100_3634.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/399555\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jszy10@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"204.13.205.130","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1277656152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229614.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jszy10","Id":229614,"Name":"jszy10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60959,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51af6abcc53dcac5532372f77e0a5fa1","RawContent":"&lt;li class=\"post-username\" id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1304309357620145\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"pmenuShow on\" id=\"pMenu-28887\"&gt;Congrats Jszy10! The bouquets are beautiful...I really like the orange flowers! The starfish boutonnieres are cute and unique. L&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span class=\"pmenuShow on\"&gt;ove the fact that you did it so cheaply too.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1444461,"PostDate":1304291644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    