unt of money on them. So, I&#039;m making our own its similar to these though, but only cost $12 and a couple hours of work. Love the dogs, its a nice touch!","Attachments":[],"Id":652965,"PostDate":1239671242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                SO cute!!! I love these but Joe does not agree w\/ spending the amount of money on them. So, I'm making our own its similar to these though, but only cost $12 and a couple hours of work. Love the dogs, its a nice touch!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212456600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":34566,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56794d2bebce49a3fd7ee8a831aa39ae","RawContent":"LOVE.IT!!!!! I&#039;m even more sold on it now that I know they can include pets. We have a shih-tzu who is our little boy! What do you do with the topper to preserve it after the wedding? Glass\/plastic box? \n I hope I have room in my budget for this, it&#039;s way too cute :)","Attachments":[],"Id":653001,"PostDate":1239672801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                LOVE.IT!!!!! I'm even more sold on it now that I know they can include pets. We have a shih-tzu who is our little boy! What do you do with the topper to preserve it after the wedding? Glass\/plastic box? <br \/> I hope I have room in my budget for this, it's way too cute <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geminigem615@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1231197388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213622.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KimmyG","Id":213622,"Name":"KimmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":34566,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d64dae69724b70f8df5626da5f0fa936","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jacilynda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;SO cute!!! I love these but Joe does not agree w\/ spending the amount of money on them. So, I&#039;m making our own its similar to these though, but only cost $12 and a couple hours of work. Love the dogs, its a nice touch!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Awesome... but you have to have some artisitc eye to do that. :) \n \n I am hoping we can find money to do this... it was not a splurge we were planning orginally, but we would love to incorporate our three dogs in the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":653063,"PostDate":1239675725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jacilynda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">SO cute!!! I love these but Joe does not agree w\/ spending the amount of money on them. So, I'm making our own its similar to these though, but only cost $12 and a couple hours of work. Love the dogs, its a nice touch!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Awesome... but you have to have some artisitc eye to do that. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> I am hoping we can find money to do this... it was not a splurge we were planning orginally, but we would love to incorporate our three dogs in the wedding.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091017\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Jamaica\/dt\/-1\/k\/25d6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...25d6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"beverly.brenner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232310220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214077.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":99,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetjamaicabride","Id":214077,"Name":"budgetjamaicabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":34566,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4c58be3d589f47aa62e274b1ce9c128","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;budgetjamaicabride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Awesome... but you have to have some artisitc eye to do that. :) \n \n I am hoping we can find money to do this... it was not a splurge we were planning orginally, but we would love to incorporate our three dogs in the wedding.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;We really want mii toppers but they are $250 so i finally decided to just try and mold them myself. Of course they aren&#039;t as great as the etsy girls cause they do them all the time, but I made the 1st and it was horrible! But i&#039;m so happy w\/ the second time around","Attachments":[],"Id":653085,"PostDate":1239676971,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>budgetjamaicabride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Awesome... but you have to have some artisitc eye to do that. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> I am hoping we can find money to do this... it was not a splurge we were planning orginally, but we would love to incorporate our three dogs in the wedding.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>We really want mii toppers but they are $250 so i finally decided to just try and mold them myself. Of course they aren't as great as the etsy girls cause they do them all the time, but I made the 1st and it was horrible! But i'm so happy w\/ the second time around\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212456600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":34566,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a05d58eadbe51196efbe3863234cb99","RawContent":"That is cute and so destination appropriate.","Attachments":[],"Id":653096,"PostDate":1239677925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That is cute and so destination appropriate.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/dreams%20wedding\/0484.jpg\">http&#58;\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/v...dding\/0484.jpg<\/a><br \/>\n<span>[IMG]<a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/www.thebump.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=ti\">http&#58;\/\/www.thebump.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=ti<\/a><span> ckers\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt375c9.aspx\">http&#58;\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt375c9.aspx<\/a><span>\" alt=\" Trying to Conceive Ticker\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[\/IMG]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrballerina@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1206662615,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208938.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon To Be Mrs. Gomez","Id":208938,"Name":"Soon To Be Mrs. Gomez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":34566,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d1aa48fbb6df02569293ba9fba5cba6","RawContent":"Thanks all! And I&#039;m definitely going to PM Tammy to let her know I got it!! I know she&#039;s wanting to see it!\n \n I&#039;m only paying around 75 dollars for this. I think it&#039;s worth it because I decided after reading the what was\/wasn&#039;t worth it thread to do a really small and simple cake - which would cost less....so I decided to do a custom cake topper!!\n \n We will preserve it probably in a plastic box or something after the wedding - I haven&#039;t really thought that far ahead...but we&#039;ll definitely keep it forever!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":653102,"PostDate":1239678244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks all! And I'm definitely going to PM Tammy to let her know I got it!! I know she's wanting to see it!<br \/> <br \/> I'm only paying around 75 dollars for this. I think it's worth it because I decided after reading the what was\/wasn't worth it thread to do a really small and simple cake - which would cost less....so I decided to do a custom cake topper!!<br \/> <br \/> We will preserve it probably in a plastic box or something after the wedding - I haven't really thought that far ahead...but we'll definitely keep it forever!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;130\/st\/20090718\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/2716\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...2716\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i634.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu61\/ninacaliguiri\/EngagementSiggyPic-2.jpg\">http:\/\/i634.photobucket.com\/albums\/u...SiggyPic-2.jpg<\/a><br><span>Bride, Groom, and 26 Guests booked! We're done!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ninacaliguiri@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1224823575,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212385.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nibsmom","Id":212385,"Name":"nibsmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":34566,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"545780429cd6005d98b88b768cb9390a","RawContent":"Definitely will add alot to your cake! I really love the idea of custom toppers","Attachments":[],"Id":653141,"PostDate":1239680077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Definitely will add alot to your cake! I really love the idea of custom toppers\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212456600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"34566","Title":"My Cake Topper from Etsy!!","LastPostDate":1429307778},"Pages":{"TotalItems":40,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
