> User Ivydulce2015 (282919)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.186.219.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ea90af9ada05364c008ccb7681ed50f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For any of you looking for videos\/photos of the resort, I found this great YouTube channel that shows you the ceremony and reception areas. It is 3 years old and there have been some remodels at the resort since these were filmed, but they at least give you an idea of the locations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/user\/RobackTravel\/videos%C2%A0&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/user\/RobackTravel\/videos&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a video of a wedding- I believe at the Captain Morgan beach location&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Vt-kA-bGryM&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a video from Barcelo regarding the wedding- although it does not show all of the locations the greatest&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=zLgdRchjd9w&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887619,"PostDate":1424982915,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">\u201c...And it is an interesting biological fact that all of us have in our veins the exact same percentage of salt in our blood that exists in the ocean, and, therefore, we have salt in our blood, in our sweat, in our tears. We are tied to the ocean. And when we go back to the sea - whether it is to sail or to watch it - we are going back from whence we came.\" -John F Kennedy<\/span><\/span>","Email":"mhagedon05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.171.182.209","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1310747969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"MissMeg","Id":242372,"Name":"MissMeg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.186.219.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d4db71c9c9c4ae3dc8969b19132f0d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have a list of the restaurants and bars at each hotel? Searching the website, they just provide the # of bars and the type of cuisine for each restaurant, not the name- from what I am seeing. If anyone could provide me a list, or a link to the information, that would be greatly appreciated!! Thank you in advance :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887631,"PostDate":1424987348,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone have a list of the restaurants and bars at each hotel? Searching the website, they just provide the # of bars and the type of cuisine for each restaurant, not the name- from what I am seeing. If anyone could provide me a list, or a link to the information, that would be greatly appreciated!! Thank you in advance <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">\u201c...And it is an interesting biological fact that all of us have in our veins the exact same percentage of salt in our blood that exists in the ocean, and, therefore, we have salt in our blood, in our sweat, in our tears. We are tied to the ocean. And when we go back to the sea - whether it is to sail or to watch it - we are going back from whence we came.\" -John F Kennedy<\/span><\/span>","Email":"mhagedon05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.171.182.209","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1310747969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"MissMeg","Id":242372,"Name":"MissMeg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed9232d31aa3dd5ab5101d3dcd884b71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MissMeg\"] If you Google Barcleo Maya Beach Resort Property Map, it will give you images of the resort and a listing of where things are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887664,"PostDate":1425007143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"242372\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/242372-missmeg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissMeg<\/span><\/a> If you Google Barcleo Maya Beach Resort Property Map, it will give you images of the resort and a listing of where things are.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412134498,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.167.198.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fc7e8ec57967736fdc708e1d9d483f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Restaurants: the newly remodeled lobby\/shopping between the Beach &amp;amp; Caribe&amp;nbsp;hotel&amp;nbsp;buildings: Strikers (sports bar with hot apps\/snacks),&amp;nbsp;Mexican Lindo (Spanish- great), &amp;nbsp;an Italian and Japanese - both good; and&amp;nbsp;a buffet as well.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the restaurants between the Colonial &amp;amp; Tropical buildings: Capri (Italian - great), Santa Fe (Steakhouse - ok), Kyoto (Japanese - ok) and Marenostrum (Seafood - ok); of course there is a buffet for bkft, lunch &amp;amp; dinner. Don&#039;t miss the breakfast buffet, it is wonderful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The &#039;grill&#039; restaurants are near the pools\/ocean and all serve buffet style for lunch.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did not eat at the Palace, though I was told the French themed one was very good.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887735,"PostDate":1425065692,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Restaurants: the newly remodeled lobby\/shopping between the Beach & Caribe\u00a0hotel\u00a0buildings: Strikers (sports bar with hot apps\/snacks),\u00a0Mexican Lindo (Spanish- great), \u00a0an Italian and Japanese - both good; and\u00a0a buffet as well.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the restaurants between the Colonial & Tropical buildings: Capri (Italian - great), Santa Fe (Steakhouse - ok), Kyoto (Japanese - ok) and Marenostrum (Seafood - ok); of course there is a buffet for bkft, lunch & dinner. Don't miss the breakfast buffet, it is wonderful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The 'grill' restaurants are near the pools\/ocean and all serve buffet style for lunch.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did not eat at the Palace, though I was told the French themed one was very good.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Denise<\/p>\n<p>Wedding 2\/2\/2015 Barcel\u00f3 Maya Tropical Resort, Rivera Maya Mexico","Email":"deniseann@writeme.com","IpAddress":"205.167.199.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422044622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281840.jpg?_r=1424741105","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shadow26","Id":281840,"Name":"shadow26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.186.219.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2ba007d518d3194311fd9ca8ce57a24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"shadow26\"] - thank you, it was the new restaurants that were added with the renovation that I really needed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cometgirl\"] - thank you, I had a property map, but I couldn&#039;t find an updated map that reflected the new restaurants near Beach\/Caribe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887752,"PostDate":1425074894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281840\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281840-shadow26\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">shadow26<\/span><\/a> - thank you, it was the new restaurants that were added with the renovation that I really needed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280150\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280150-cometgirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cometgirl<\/span><\/a> - thank you, I had a property map, but I couldn't find an updated map that reflected the new restaurants near Beach\/Caribe.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">\u201c...And it is an interesting biological fact that all of us have in our veins the exact same percentage of salt in our blood that exists in the ocean, and, therefore, we have salt in our blood, in our sweat, in our tears. We are tied to the ocean. And when we go back to the sea - whether it is to sail or to watch it - we are going back from whence we came.\" -John F Kennedy<\/span><\/span>","Email":"mhagedon05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.171.182.209","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1310747969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"MissMeg","Id":242372,"Name":"MissMeg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.77.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10be255826ca6ceb6fb8793603043b82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Newbie following this forum! Great info here. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888055,"PostDate":1425343332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Newbie following this forum! Great info here. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandabeard@trentu.ca","IpAddress":"99.236.77.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425325262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"amandalynn","Id":282295,"Name":"amandalynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.167.199.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4170474a41f90c97790895a0bce0b807","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For those with a spare &lt;strong&gt;35 minutes&lt;\/strong&gt;... here is a link to the YouTube video I put together of my wedding day and full ceremony&amp;nbsp;on 2\/2\/15&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;http:\/\/youtu.be\/qgLhRs3kigI&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The pictures were taken around&amp;nbsp;the Barcel\u00f3 Maya&amp;nbsp;Tropical resort (front lobby and beach), the symbolic ceremony was at the Capital Morgan beach, and dinner was on the Capitan Morgan grill terrace.   Everything was fantastic!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MissMeg\"] the map they give you onsite is still the old one too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888173,"PostDate":1425413187,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For those with a spare <strong>35 minutes<\/strong>... here is a link to the YouTube video I put together of my wedding day and full ceremony\u00a0on 2\/2\/15<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/qgLhRs3kigI?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The pictures were taken around\u00a0the Barcel\u00f3 Maya\u00a0Tropical resort (front lobby and beach), the symbolic ceremony was at the Capital Morgan beach, and dinner was on the Capitan Morgan grill terrace.\u00a0\u00a0 Everything was fantastic!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"242372\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/242372-missmeg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissMeg<\/span><\/a> the map they give you onsite is still the old one too.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Denise<\/p>\n<p>Wedding 2\/2\/2015 Barcel\u00f3 Maya Tropical Resort, Rivera Maya Mexico","Email":"deniseann@writeme.com","IpAddress":"205.167.199.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422044622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281840.jpg?_r=1424741105","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shadow26","Id":281840,"Name":"shadow26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22a7d1cadc91b2569bba99c9cdd4859c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"shadow26\" post=\"1888173\" timestamp=\"1425409587\"]\nFor those with a spare [b]35 minutes[\/b]... here is a link to the YouTube video I put together of my wedding day and full ceremony on 2\/2\/15\n \n[url=\"http:\/\/youtu.be\/qgLhRs3kigI\"]http:\/\/youtu.be\/qgLhRs3kigI[\/url]\n \nThe pictures were taken around the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Tropical resort (front lobby and beach), the symbolic ceremony was at the Capital Morgan beach, and dinner was on the Capitan Morgan grill terrace.   Everything was fantastic!!!\n \n@[member=\"MissMeg\"] the map they give you onsite is still the old one too.[\/quote]\nAwesome pics @[member=\"shadow26\"] thanks for sharing !! Was that the resort photographer?","Attachments":[],"Id":1890571,"PostDate":1427171664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>shadow26, on 03 March 2015 - 12:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>For those with a spare <strong>35 minutes<\/strong>... here is a link to the YouTube video I put together of my wedding day and full ceremony\u00a0on 2\/2\/15<br>\n\u00a0<br><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/qgLhRs3kigI?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThe pictures were taken around\u00a0the Barcel\u00f3 Maya\u00a0Tropical resort (front lobby and beach), the symbolic ceremony was at the Capital Morgan beach, and dinner was on the Capitan Morgan grill terrace.\u00a0\u00a0 Everything was fantastic!!!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"242372\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/242372-missmeg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissMeg<\/span><\/a> the map they give you onsite is still the old one too.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nAwesome pics @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281840\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281840-shadow26\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">shadow26<\/span><\/a> thanks for sharing !! Was that the resort photographer?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412308287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.114.197.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427742825,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54674c3223ecf8cd97d92dd3ae6a75f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here is a link to my review of the Barcelo Maya Colonial, and our wedding info. &amp;nbsp;We got married on March 14, 2015. &amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask me any questions!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4978-barcelo-maya-colonial\/#review&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4978-barcelo-maya-colonial\/#review&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891288,"PostDate":1427742775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here is a link to my review of the Barcelo Maya Colonial, and our wedding info. \u00a0We got married on March 14, 2015. \u00a0Feel free to ask me any questions!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4978-barcelo-maya-colonial\/#review' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...olonial\/#review<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharissa.murphy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.21.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385531229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275354.jpg?_r=1389041741","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":284,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"riskyteacher","Id":275354,"Name":"riskyteacher","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.250.54.56","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad376c52a15f38a2cc0458a5b60cc331","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;We were going to go with our resorts photography as we didn&#039;t want to pay the 500$ extra. however we found Octavios webpage though a link on this site, his SIX hour package plus the 500$ deposit and 10% off comes under what we were going to pay from ocean studio. &amp;nbsp;Looking over his photos we decided that he was the right choice for a photographer. &amp;nbsp;Octavio was very quick to respond with any questions\/answers we had regarding his services. &amp;nbsp;We are getting married in TWO WEEKS! and can&#039;t wait to meet him and get the photos done. &amp;nbsp;We will let you all know how it goes when we return!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;This is his website if you want more information&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/index.html\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.octaviomo....com\/index.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;He has a promotion on right now for 10%!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893865,"PostDate":1429662428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">We were going to go with our resorts photography as we didn't want to pay the 500$ extra. however we found Octavios webpage though a link on this site, his SIX hour package plus the 500$ deposit and 10% off comes under what we were going to pay from ocean studio. \u00a0Looking over his photos we decided that he was the right choice for a photographer. \u00a0Octavio was very quick to respond with any questions\/answers we had regarding his services. \u00a0We are getting married in TWO WEEKS! and can't wait to meet him and get the photos done. \u00a0We will let you all know how it goes when we return!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">This is his website if you want more information<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/index.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.octaviomo....com\/index.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">He has a promotion on right now for 10%!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joshjohnbaun@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"205.250.54.56","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428950598,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JoshB","Id":282725,"Name":"JoshB","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4617,"TotalPages":462,"CurrentPage":4600,"NextPage":4610,"PreviousPage":4590,"LastPage":4610},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
