{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":15,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":2646,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1837570,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":275354,"Name":"riskyteacher","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275354.jpg?_r=1389041741","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":284,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1394493112,"LastPoster":{"Id":282725,"Name":"JoshB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1837570,"PostDate":1394493112,"PostContent":"Our wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharissa.murphy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.21.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385531229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275354.jpg?_r=1389041741","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":284,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"riskyteacher","Id":275354,"Name":"riskyteacher","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.22.16.55","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c72b23799d73e79981becce4651926de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Our wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we are not allowed to use an outside photographer. &amp;nbsp;If we do, we will be charged $500. &amp;nbsp;The resort photographer is Ocean Photo studio&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and their packages are PRICEY! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve attached their package in PDF format. &amp;nbsp;Holy moly....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anybody worked with the Ocean Photo Studio? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anybody got a less expensive package through them? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anybody have any photographer suggestions that would be more affordable?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At this point, we are looking at paying the way for our photographer friend to attend Mexico, then they would take all of our photos as our guest and we wouldn&#039;t have to pay the $500 charge. &amp;nbsp;Originally, I&#039;d budgeted like $800 for photos, because I only want digital copies of photos from us getting ready, the ceremony and cocktail hour\/reception and then a dvd video of the ceremony. &amp;nbsp;I don&#039;t want to deal with the shipping of prints as well as photo books etc. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;d rather take a CD home with the photos, then develop them at home. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any suggestions would be greatly appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837570,"PostDate":1394493112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Our wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we are not allowed to use an outside photographer. \u00a0If we do, we will be charged $500. \u00a0The resort photographer is Ocean Photo studio\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/<\/a>\u00a0and their packages are PRICEY! \u00a0I've attached their package in PDF format. \u00a0Holy moly....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anybody worked with the Ocean Photo Studio? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anybody got a less expensive package through them? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anybody have any photographer suggestions that would be more affordable?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At this point, we are looking at paying the way for our photographer friend to attend Mexico, then they would take all of our photos as our guest and we wouldn't have to pay the $500 charge. \u00a0Originally, I'd budgeted like $800 for photos, because I only want digital copies of photos from us getting ready, the ceremony and cocktail hour\/reception and then a dvd video of the ceremony. \u00a0I don't want to deal with the shipping of prints as well as photo books etc. \u00a0I'd rather take a CD home with the photos, then develop them at home. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions would be greatly appreciated!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharissa.murphy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.21.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385531229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275354.jpg?_r=1389041741","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":284,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"riskyteacher","Id":275354,"Name":"riskyteacher","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by omontes, 26 March 2014 - 10:06 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1395857189,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e983d5d106feeaa0fbda6fc0f23fc6bc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"riskyteacher\" post=\"1837570\" timestamp=\"1394489512\"]\nOur wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we are not allowed to use an outside photographer.  If we do, we will be charged $500.  The resort photographer is Ocean Photo studio [url=\"http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/\"]http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/[\/url] and their packages are PRICEY!  I&#039;ve attached their package in PDF format.  Holy moly....\n\nHas anybody worked with the Ocean Photo Studio?  \nHas anybody got a less expensive package through them?  \nDoes anybody have any photographer suggestions that would be more affordable?\n\nAt this point, we are looking at paying the way for our photographer friend to attend Mexico, then they would take all of our photos as our guest and we wouldn&#039;t have to pay the $500 charge.  Originally, I&#039;d budgeted like $800 for photos, because I only want digital copies of photos from us getting ready, the ceremony and cocktail hour\/reception and then a dvd video of the ceremony.  I don&#039;t want to deal with the shipping of prints as well as photo books etc.  I&#039;d rather take a CD home with the photos, then develop them at home.  \n\nAny suggestions would be greatly appreciated![\/quote]\nHi riskyteacher!\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nOur job is to give them the best service at the best price, We work in Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, etc; we have different packages to suit your budget![\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74464]\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74782]\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74486]\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74775]\n[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n\nIf you are interested have a look at our site, we have galleries there, I assure you delighted to stay and the prices are very affordable! \n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com[\/url]\n\nif you have doubts or questions gladly attend you your doubts.\n\nHave a nice day, Greetings![\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1840667,"PostDate":1395857148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>riskyteacher, on 10 March 2014 - 03:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Our wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we are not allowed to use an outside photographer. \u00a0If we do, we will be charged $500. \u00a0The resort photographer is Ocean Photo studio\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/<\/a>\u00a0and their packages are PRICEY! \u00a0I've attached their package in PDF format. \u00a0Holy moly....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anybody worked with the Ocean Photo Studio? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anybody got a less expensive package through them? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anybody have any photographer suggestions that would be more affordable?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At this point, we are looking at paying the way for our photographer friend to attend Mexico, then they would take all of our photos as our guest and we wouldn't have to pay the $500 charge. \u00a0Originally, I'd budgeted like $800 for photos, because I only want digital copies of photos from us getting ready, the ceremony and cocktail hour\/reception and then a dvd video of the ceremony. \u00a0I don't want to deal with the shipping of prints as well as photo books etc. \u00a0I'd rather take a CD home with the photos, then develop them at home. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions would be greatly appreciated!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi riskyteacher!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Our job is to give them the best service at the best price, We work in Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, etc; we have different packages to suit your budget!<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74464-moon-palace-chappel\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17608\/sml_gallery_238129_17608_320788.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Moon Palace Chappel'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Moon Palace Chappel' id='sml_image_view_74464' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74782-a5a9435\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17628\/sml_gallery_238129_17628_74543.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='A5A9435'  width='200' height='134'  alt='A5A9435' id='sml_image_view_74782' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74486-iberostar-playacar\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17608\/sml_gallery_238129_17608_43393.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IberoStar Playacar'  width='200' height='134'  alt='IberoStar Playacar' id='sml_image_view_74486' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74775-flowers\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17628\/sml_gallery_238129_17628_120835.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='flowers!'  width='200' height='134'  alt='flowers!' id='sml_image_view_74775' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">If you are interested have a look at our site, we have galleries there, I assure you delighted to stay and the prices are very affordable!\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com<\/a><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">if you have doubts or questions gladly attend you your doubts.<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">Have a nice day, Greetings!<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"octavio@momocode.com","IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1301000847,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238129.png?_r=1394907225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"omontes","Id":238129,"Name":"omontes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"86.144.197.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c33fce05ffce58ca05b52387d5cab427","RawContent":"[quote name=\"riskyteacher\" post=\"1837570\" timestamp=\"1394489512\"]\nOur wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we are not allowed to use an outside photographer.  If we do, we will be charged $500.  The resort photographer is Ocean Photo studio [url=\"http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/\"]http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/[\/url] and their packages are PRICEY!  I&#039;ve attached their package in PDF format.  Holy moly....\n\nHas anybody worked with the Ocean Photo Studio?  \nHas anybody got a less expensive package through them?  \nDoes anybody have any photographer suggestions that would be more affordable?\n\nAt this point, we are looking at paying the way for our photographer friend to attend Mexico, then they would take all of our photos as our guest and we wouldn&#039;t have to pay the $500 charge.  Originally, I&#039;d budgeted like $800 for photos, because I only want digital copies of photos from us getting ready, the ceremony and cocktail hour\/reception and then a dvd video of the ceremony.  I don&#039;t want to deal with the shipping of prints as well as photo books etc.  I&#039;d rather take a CD home with the photos, then develop them at home.  \n\nAny suggestions would be greatly appreciated![\/quote]Hello,\n\nI am in the same boat with this resort. I have emailed them. No answer and their website doesn&#039;t seem to work. Doesn&#039;t seem too reliable. is it possible to get that pdf from you? it won&#039;t let me open it on here.","Attachments":[],"Id":1864509,"PostDate":1407195740,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>riskyteacher, on 10 March 2014 - 03:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Our wedding is spring break 2015, and the wedding coordinator at the Barcelo informed me that we are not allowed to use an outside photographer. \u00a0If we do, we will be charged $500. \u00a0The resort photographer is Ocean Photo studio\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.oceanphotostudio.com\/en\/<\/a>\u00a0and their packages are PRICEY! \u00a0I've attached their package in PDF format. \u00a0Holy moly....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anybody worked with the Ocean Photo Studio? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anybody got a less expensive package through them? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anybody have any photographer suggestions that would be more affordable?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At this point, we are looking at paying the way for our photographer friend to attend Mexico, then they would take all of our photos as our guest and we wouldn't have to pay the $500 charge. \u00a0Originally, I'd budgeted like $800 for photos, because I only want digital copies of photos from us getting ready, the ceremony and cocktail hour\/reception and then a dvd video of the ceremony. \u00a0I don't want to deal with the shipping of prints as well as photo books etc. \u00a0I'd rather take a CD home with the photos, then develop them at home. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions would be greatly appreciated!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am in the same boat with this resort. I have emailed them. No answer and their website doesn't seem to work. Doesn't seem too reliable. is it possible to get that pdf from you? it won't let me open it on here.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morgan.ann.randles@gmail.com","IpAddress":"86.144.197.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407067412,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BarceloJan2015","Id":279277,"Name":"BarceloJan2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.2.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2900eba371466183234fb340b26a7f20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was told resort follow a boring or outdated rule of getting shoot, some of them where administrative personnel or had other work than a photographer, make sure your photographer has enough experience as a main photographer if you go for them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you want a different vision of a real artist, look for an artist, I do my photography and I edit them, I know how will they look like at the end.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864685,"PostDate":1407276053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was told resort follow a boring or outdated rule of getting shoot, some of them where administrative personnel or had other work than a photographer, make sure your photographer has enough experience as a main photographer if you go for them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want a different vision of a real artist, look for an artist, I do my photography and I edit them, I know how will they look like at the end.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n<p>Ivan <strong>Luckie Photography<\/strong><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\">http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com<\/a><br>\nwedding journalistic, creative portraits and the best underwater photography","Email":"iluckie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.153.177.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1302210095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238636.jpg?_r=1389586310","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IvanLuckiePhotography","Id":238636,"Name":"IvanLuckiePhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.22.16.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b52be819447c328342028d515b685b73","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;UPDATE:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have decided to go with Ocean Studio, and have agreed on 5hrs photo, and an edited&amp;nbsp;video dvd of the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; I am taking a RAW cd home of photos (no edits) and am having a friend edit the photos at home so I don&#039;t have to wait months for my photos to arrive by mail, I save a ton of money, AND I can have a say in the edits.&amp;nbsp; The resort still has a strict \"no outsider\" policy, and a $500 fee if you bring an outsider photographer into the resort.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873940,"PostDate":1412186360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">UPDATE:<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have decided to go with Ocean Studio, and have agreed on 5hrs photo, and an edited\u00a0video dvd of the ceremony.\u00a0 I am taking a RAW cd home of photos (no edits) and am having a friend edit the photos at home so I don't have to wait months for my photos to arrive by mail, I save a ton of money, AND I can have a say in the edits.\u00a0 The resort still has a strict \"no outsider\" policy, and a $500 fee if you bring an outsider photographer into the resort.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharissa.murphy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.1.21.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385531229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275354.jpg?_r=1389041741","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":284,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"riskyteacher","Id":275354,"Name":"riskyteacher","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5ad4c16ac6e31c32bb84f233b7921db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I believe Moon Palace uses Ocean as well. The outside Vendor fee for Palace is $800. I have not received a list of Palace approved vendors yet, however, I have seen some prices before of preferred &amp;nbsp;photographers and I feel that hiring an outside photographer, with the vendor fee, still lets me save money and gives me more for the money.. as in more time. I also do not want printed pictures, I would rather them on a desk or drive and I will have them edited and printed myself. I don&#039;t mind if they are edited, but I don&#039;t want them printed.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875904,"PostDate":1413480997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I believe Moon Palace uses Ocean as well. The outside Vendor fee for Palace is $800. I have not received a list of Palace approved vendors yet, however, I have seen some prices before of preferred \u00a0photographers and I feel that hiring an outside photographer, with the vendor fee, still lets me save money and gives me more for the money.. as in more time. I also do not want printed pictures, I would rather them on a desk or drive and I will have them edited and printed myself. I don't mind if they are edited, but I don't want them printed.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401306470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.131.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11d0cf16c90684f2fbe96423f752aabd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"riskyteacher\" post=\"1873940\" timestamp=\"1412182760\"]\n[u][b][color=#ff0000]UPDATE:[\/color][\/b][\/u]\n\nWe have decided to go with Ocean Studio, and have agreed on 5hrs photo, and an edited video dvd of the ceremony.  I am taking a RAW cd home of photos (no edits) and am having a friend edit the photos at home so I don&#039;t have to wait months for my photos to arrive by mail, I save a ton of money, AND I can have a say in the edits.  The resort still has a strict \"no outsider\" policy, and a $500 fee if you bring an outsider photographer into the resort.[\/quote]that 500UD OVF is shitty! damn! give money away!\n\nphotography begins in the camera and ends there, Digital is not about how it looks but how much information you have in the file to later get what who took it wanted, I have done a huge research to change my prices again, hope you give yourself a big change to have things that matter for ever a place in your life","Attachments":[],"Id":1875947,"PostDate":1413519537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>riskyteacher, on 01 October 2014 - 09:59 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><u><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">UPDATE:<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have decided to go with Ocean Studio, and have agreed on 5hrs photo, and an edited\u00a0video dvd of the ceremony.\u00a0 I am taking a RAW cd home of photos (no edits) and am having a friend edit the photos at home so I don't have to wait months for my photos to arrive by mail, I save a ton of money, AND I can have a say in the edits.\u00a0 The resort still has a strict \"no outsider\" policy, and a $500 fee if you bring an outsider photographer into the resort.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>that 500UD OVF is shitty! damn! give money away!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>photography begins in the camera and ends there, Digital is not about how it looks but how much information you have in the file to later get what who took it wanted, I have done a huge research to change my prices again, hope you give yourself a big change to have things that matter for ever a place in your life<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n<p>Ivan <strong>Luckie Photography<\/strong><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\">http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com<\/a><br>\nwedding journalistic, creative portraits and the best underwater photography","Email":"iluckie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.153.177.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1302210095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238636.jpg?_r=1389586310","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IvanLuckiePhotography","Id":238636,"Name":"IvanLuckiePhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"599bb0ce882405afba1748697c114e6a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"riskyteacher\"] - we are getting married there May 2015 and we hired Octavio Montes (he posted above). &amp;nbsp;www.octaviomontes.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We actually were just at the resort in Sept and met with him and Ocean Beach and decided on Octavio. We found him to understand us much more as a couple and his packages are much more reasonable (even if you have to pay the outside vendor fee). He also offers 10% off which helps!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876051,"PostDate":1413600660,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275354\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275354-riskyteacher\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">riskyteacher<\/span><\/a> - we are getting married there May 2015 and we hired Octavio Montes (he posted above). \u00a0www.octaviomontes.com<\/p>\n<p>We actually were just at the resort in Sept and met with him and Ocean Beach and decided on Octavio. We found him to understand us much more as a couple and his packages are much more reasonable (even if you have to pay the outside vendor fee). He also offers 10% off which helps!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412134498,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.157.138.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8a6269dbb813d26b43055377202bd6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I had the same issue. Found a outsider photographer, paid the fee , got some amazing quality photography and still saved a lot of money. Now I compare the pics I got with those which was included in the hotel package and I am &amp;nbsp;so relived that I&#039;ve made the right choice.   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877510,"PostDate":1414878842,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I had the same issue. Found a outsider photographer, paid the fee , got some amazing quality photography and still saved a lot of money. Now I compare the pics I got with those which was included in the hotel package and I am \u00a0so relived that I've made the right choice. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nataliakersaw@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.157.138.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414725508,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NataliaKersaw","Id":280929,"Name":"NataliaKersaw","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.157.138.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76562,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9efda18549460b328a026960f7b39281","RawContent":"[quote name=\"NataliaKersaw\" post=\"1877510\" timestamp=\"1414875242\"]\nI had the same issue. Found a outsider photographer, paid the fee , got some amazing quality photography and still saved a lot of money. Now I compare the pics I got with those which was included in the hotel package and I am  so relived that I&#039;ve made the right choice.[\/quote]\nI would prefer to pay the fee if the photograper is worth it. NataliaKersaw Could you give me some info about your experience?","Attachments":[],"Id":1877520,"PostDate":1414891634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>NataliaKersaw, on 01 November 2014 - 01:54 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I had the same issue. Found a outsider photographer, paid the fee , got some amazing quality photography and still saved a lot of money. Now I compare the pics I got with those which was included in the hotel package and I am \u00a0so relived that I've made the right choice. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would prefer to pay the fee if the photograper is worth it. NataliaKersaw Could you give me some info about your experience?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cristinaleosmith@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.157.138.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414888115,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Crisandmark","Id":280955,"Name":"Crisandmark","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76562","Title":"Barcelo Maya Photographer?  Ocean Photo Studio Package","LastPostDate":1428950890},"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
