Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":26,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":1429,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1878307,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1415896281,"LastPoster":{"Id":282367,"Name":"MNsunseeker","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1878307,"PostDate":1415896281,"PostContent":"So I've had a bunch of girls from this site ask me how much I paid for my lights at my reception...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386811154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa0e91a656565a0b45328d5ef22b8e08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I&#039;ve had a bunch of girls from this site ask me how much I paid for my lights at my reception because everyone&#039;s hotels are charging them so much. I found a girl in Playa who has a TON of decorations and you can actually rent them from her. I rented all of my decorations from her because it saved me&amp;nbsp;so much money.&amp;nbsp;For example, the hotel wanted to charge me $200 per strand&amp;nbsp;for those bulb lights to hang above the dance floor. She charged me $15.&amp;nbsp;Since I was saving so much money through her, I rented almost everything from her for the rehearsal dinner, ceremony, cocktail party and reception.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Her Facebook page is Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor. The profile picture looks like a white logo with purple writing. Everything she rents out is on her facebook page with pricing. She was so easy to work with and everything looked beautiful. I met her in town and picked up my decorations so the hotel couldn&#039;t charge me a $800 outside vendor fee.&amp;nbsp;Some pics are below. Just wanted to share with you all because I know how much everyone wants to save money!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can contact her on her facebook page or through her and her husband&#039;s website. The contact webpage is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/loveandrum.com\/contact\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/loveandrum.com\/contact\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pictures - some of these are professional and some are just what my friends took, so sorry for the change in quality. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the ceremony, I rented the chair sashes, the mason jars, the bottles hanging from the back of the gazebo and she also did petal rose cone holders for chairs closest to the aisle so the guests could throw rose petals at us when we walked down the aisle after the ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79027]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78998]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78999]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78991]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78990]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I don&#039;t have pictures of the post ceremony cocktail party yet, but I did rent bottles and vases from her for that event.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;For the reception, I rented everything. She did my light wall (which made some really cool pictures), all of my lighting (bulbs overhead, paper lanterns, pool lining lanterns, lights up the post on the bed), all the decorations for my sweetheart table, entry table, reception tables.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79038]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79026]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78995]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78994]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79034]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79006]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79029]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79031]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78988]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78987]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the rehearsal dinner, I kept it simple and just did the centerpieces for the round tables and a long row of bottles\/vases for the head table.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79037]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79035]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79036]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878307,"PostDate":1415896281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I've had a bunch of girls from this site ask me how much I paid for my lights at my reception because everyone's hotels are charging them so much. I found a girl in Playa who has a TON of decorations and you can actually rent them from her. I rented all of my decorations from her because it saved me\u00a0so much money.\u00a0For example, the hotel wanted to charge me $200 per strand\u00a0for those bulb lights to hang above the dance floor. She charged me $15.\u00a0Since I was saving so much money through her, I rented almost everything from her for the rehearsal dinner, ceremony, cocktail party and reception.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Her Facebook page is Love & Lace Wedding Decor. The profile picture looks like a white logo with purple writing. Everything she rents out is on her facebook page with pricing. She was so easy to work with and everything looked beautiful. I met her in town and picked up my decorations so the hotel couldn't charge me a $800 outside vendor fee.\u00a0Some pics are below. Just wanted to share with you all because I know how much everyone wants to save money!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can contact her on her facebook page or through her and her husband's website. The contact webpage is <a href='http:\/\/loveandrum.com\/contact\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/loveandrum.com\/contact\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pictures - some of these are professional and some are just what my friends took, so sorry for the change in quality. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the ceremony, I rented the chair sashes, the mason jars, the bottles hanging from the back of the gazebo and she also did petal rose cone holders for chairs closest to the aisle so the guests could throw rose petals at us when we walked down the aisle after the ceremony.<\/p>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79027-gazebo-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_128367.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Gazebo 2'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Gazebo 2' id='sml_image_view_79027' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78998-chairs-with-jars-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_77946.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Chairs with jars 2'  width='200' height='125'  alt='Chairs with jars 2' id='sml_image_view_78998' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78999-chairs-with-jars\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_58715.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Chairs with jars'  width='200' height='123'  alt='Chairs with jars' id='sml_image_view_78999' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78991-gazebo-3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_12232.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Gazebo 3'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Gazebo 3' id='sml_image_view_78991' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78990-gazebo-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_64296.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Gazebo 2'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Gazebo 2' id='sml_image_view_78990' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I don't have pictures of the post ceremony cocktail party yet, but I did rent bottles and vases from her for that event.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>For the reception, I rented everything. She did my light wall (which made some really cool pictures), all of my lighting (bulbs overhead, paper lanterns, pool lining lanterns, lights up the post on the bed), all the decorations for my sweetheart table, entry table, reception tables.<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79038-table-decorations-derek\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_98143.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Table Decorations Derek'  width='200' height='126'  alt='Table Decorations Derek' id='sml_image_view_79038' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79026-decor-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_134435.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Decor 1'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Decor 1' id='sml_image_view_79026' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78995-reception-lighting\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_127349.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Reception lighting'  width='200' height='133'  alt='Reception lighting' id='sml_image_view_78995' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78994-pool-lanterns\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_31950.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Pool lanterns'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Pool lanterns' id='sml_image_view_78994' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79034-kiss-light-wall\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_52021.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Kiss Light Wall'  width='159' height='200'  alt='Kiss Light Wall' id='sml_image_view_79034' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79006-sweetheart-table\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_51544.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Sweetheart Table'  width='200' height='125'  alt='Sweetheart Table' id='sml_image_view_79006' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79029-bed-lighting\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_153292.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Bed Lighting'  width='200' height='124'  alt='Bed Lighting' id='sml_image_view_79029' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79031-escort-card\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_96352.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Escort Card'  width='200' height='124'  alt='Escort Card' id='sml_image_view_79031' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78988-entry-table-after-flowers\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_39095.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Entry table after flowers'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Entry table after flowers' id='sml_image_view_78988' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78987-dance-pic\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_39814.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Dance Pic'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Dance Pic' id='sml_image_view_78987' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>For the rehearsal dinner, I kept it simple and just did the centerpieces for the round tables and a long row of bottles\/vases for the head table.<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79037-rehearsal-dinner-table-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_49024.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Rehearsal Dinner Table 1'  width='200' height='119'  alt='Rehearsal Dinner Table 1' id='sml_image_view_79037' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79035-rehearsal-dinner-3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_86788.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Rehearsal Dinner 3'  width='200' height='126'  alt='Rehearsal Dinner 3' id='sml_image_view_79035' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79036-rehearsal-dinner-head-table\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17894\/sml_gallery_275598_17894_109964.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Rehearsal Dinner head table'  width='200' height='126'  alt='Rehearsal Dinner head table' id='sml_image_view_79036' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386811154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.73.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 13 November 2014 - 09:51 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1415901096,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3834bb17a0afcf2058f03608143b3eae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great photos, khmciver - looks like your wedding was Amazing and Beautiful!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;THX for sharing and also the great info on saving money by renting decor items from Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor - yeh!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you and your new hubby every happiness in your lives together going forward - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10571930_10152584137814487_5304830141305077166_o.jpg\" alt=\"10571930_10152584137814487_5304830141305\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1890556_10152584135334487_5956988475527457209_o.jpg\" alt=\"1890556_10152584135334487_59569884755274\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878312,"PostDate":1415900993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great photos, khmciver - looks like your wedding was Amazing and Beautiful!!!<\/p>\n<p>THX for sharing and also the great info on saving money by renting decor items from Love & Lace Wedding Decor - yeh!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you and your new hubby every happiness in your lives together going forward - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10571930_10152584137814487_5304830141305077166_o.jpg\" alt=\"10571930_10152584137814487_5304830141305\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1890556_10152584135334487_5956988475527457209_o.jpg\" alt=\"1890556_10152584135334487_59569884755274\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d0b1e6d2028e87f278b1f0d4a8635b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"khmciver\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;THANK YOU so much for sharing this information.&amp;nbsp; This will be incredibly useful for me come next June.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love this forum and I&#039;m so impressed at how brides return back to the forum and provide useful pointers.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s so appreciated and there&#039;s no way I would have found this info myself.\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878318,"PostDate":1415905126,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@khmciver<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>THANK YOU so much for sharing this information.\u00a0 This will be incredibly useful for me come next June.<\/p>\n<p>I love this forum and I'm so impressed at how brides return back to the forum and provide useful pointers.\u00a0 It's so appreciated and there's no way I would have found this info myself.<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396986452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de603f5bc0a8667ba60ed19afb12cb64","RawContent":"If I would have know this months ago!!! It&#039;s a great idea. I do remember thinking to myself as I viewed your pics &#039;how did she get that stuff there?!&#039; It&#039;s beautiful. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1878352,"PostDate":1415931218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If I would have know this months ago!!! It's a great idea. I do remember thinking to myself as I viewed your pics 'how did she get that stuff there?!' It's beautiful. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.234.72.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19323a224980711b0422e54cda995068","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalero\"] - you&#039;re welcome!! It was so annoying when the brides would just disappear!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878412,"PostDate":1415997918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@veryvalero - you're welcome!! It was so annoying when the brides would just disappear!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386811154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f73f3725bfa00d0b7dfe63819ee6935b","RawContent":"@[member=\"khmciver\"]\n\n\nHow did you set up the wall with the lights and the string lights above the dining area?\n\n\nDid you have to give them the instructions, or did you just hand over the items and ideas and they constructed it all for you?\n\n\nWould like to know any tips. \n\n\nThanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878851,"PostDate":1416587147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @khmciver<br><br>\nHow did you set up the wall with the lights and the string lights above the dining area?<br><br>\nDid you have to give them the instructions, or did you just hand over the items and ideas and they constructed it all for you?<br><br>\nWould like to know any tips. <br><br>\nThanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401140033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.80.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45f0a87a456062464c34b419fe0f9e67","RawContent":"@[member=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\"]\n\n\nI gave them the strands of lights and the fabric and lights for my light wall. Told them my vision and they Executed it perfectly","Attachments":[],"Id":1878908,"PostDate":1416639774,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278120\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nI gave them the strands of lights and the fabric and lights for my light wall. Told them my vision and they Executed it perfectly \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386811154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b7b9475af037587632377aaf1d079c7","RawContent":"@[member=\"khmciver\"] oh wow! I can&#039;t believe they constructed a light way for you like that so perfectly! That&#039;s awesome!!!!! Really cool. It was so romantic as the back drop on some photos! Good vision.","Attachments":[],"Id":1878914,"PostDate":1416671270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @khmciver oh wow! I can't believe they constructed a light way for you like that so perfectly! That's awesome!!!!! Really cool. It was so romantic as the back drop on some photos! Good vision.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401140033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.80.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"906db570ff27c0ccc9c17bda61ad0bbb","RawContent":"@[member=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\"]\n\n\nThank you!! It was really pretty. It sort of became a picture background like prom! Haha! I loved it. It was super easy to do. They put up that pipe and drape, then a white sheet over that and then the lights which were just christmas lights and then the lace. I was so happy I was able to do it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1878920,"PostDate":1416674795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278120\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nThank you!! It was really pretty. It sort of became a picture background like prom! Haha! I loved it. It was super easy to do. They put up that pipe and drape, then a white sheet over that and then the lights which were just christmas lights and then the lace. I was so happy I was able to do it. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386811154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec730a5ed1b9392eaf1450a7b8359aa0","RawContent":"@[member=\"khmciver\"] heck ya! And I bet your guests loved it too! Is Azul a hotel? If so, you took what could of been the typical hotel wedding (some that I&#039;ve been to not knocking hotel weddings) and totally transformed it into a magical atmosphere. Again, I&#039;m really impressed!\n\n\nYou gave me inspiration. I was trying to think of ways to make a big venue with a small guest list not seem so overwhelmingly disproportionate. Your ideas helped me envision a cozy space!\n\n\nThanks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878922,"PostDate":1416676975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @khmciver heck ya! And I bet your guests loved it too! Is Azul a hotel? If so, you took what could of been the typical hotel wedding (some that I've been to not knocking hotel weddings) and totally transformed it into a magical atmosphere. Again, I'm really impressed!<br><br>\nYou gave me inspiration. I was trying to think of ways to make a big venue with a small guest list not seem so overwhelmingly disproportionate. Your ideas helped me envision a cozy space!<br><br>\nThanks!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401140033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78374","Title":"Decor Rental In Playa - Way Cheaper","LastPostDate":1427258644},"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
